Grammar:

Rule 0     S' -> PROGRAM
Rule 1     PROGRAM -> DEVICES CMDS
Rule 2     PROGRAM -> DEVICES
Rule 3     DEVICES -> DEVICE DEVICES
Rule 4     DEVICES -> DEVICE
Rule 5     DEVICE -> device : { namedevice , observation }
Rule 6     DEVICE -> device : { namedevice }
Rule 7     CMDS -> CMD . CMDS
Rule 8     CMDS -> CMD .
Rule 9     CMD -> ACT
Rule 10    CMD -> ATTRIB
Rule 11    CMD -> OBSACT
Rule 12    ATTRIB -> set observation = VAR
Rule 13    ACT -> ACTION namedevice
Rule 14    ACT -> enviar alerta ( msg ) namedevice
Rule 15    ACT -> enviar alerta ( msg , observation ) namedevice
Rule 16    ACT -> enviar alerta ( msg ) para todos : NAME
Rule 17    OBSACT -> se OBS entao ACT
Rule 18    OBSACT -> se OBS entao ACT senao ACT
Rule 19    OBS -> observation oplogic VAR
Rule 20    OBS -> observation oplogic VAR & & OBS
Rule 21    ACTION -> action
Rule 22    NAME -> namedevice
Rule 23    NAME -> namedevice , NAME
Rule 24    VAR -> number
Rule 25    VAR -> boolean

Terminals, with rules where they appear:

&                    : 20 20
